        "class_code": "EFFICACY",
        "approval_date": "2014-04-23",
        "description": {
          "text": "Added pediatric data from PKU-015 substudies and response to the Pediatric Written Request for Kuvan in PKU patients four years of age or younger",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "PMC 948-1 BioMarin commits to designing and implementing a safety, efficacy, and pharmacokinetics study with Kuvan (sapropterin dihydrochloride) in patients with PKU who are four years of age or younger at study entry. Efficacy is to be assessed by the pharmacodynamic outcome measure of blood phenylalanine levels over a six-month period of treatment. A study protocol will be submitted to CDER by June 14, 2008, for concurrence, and the study will be initiated by December 14, 2008. The final study report for this study will be submitted to CDER by June 14, 2010.",
              "doc_id": "beb0d968-fb6f-5bef-8061-9052920ca8eb",
